    claude-local                     Claude Code on the model in config/local/ollama.json
    claude-local --fallback          on the fallback model
    claude-local --show              show the variables and the command; start nothing

Your shell profile and your Claude Code settings do not change. `claude` in
another terminal still uses your subscription. See tools/tokenomics/local.py.
"""
